{"title":"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be a point on the triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> (inside or on the boundary). Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/0/f106a08324aeede61d0a93c746b359169b9a93a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_a , r_b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"38\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/7/aa7620a597a75f93da094b677121f6080020f2fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> be the\ndistance from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to the sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/5/e657259c0995d2c36d46744bb4aa81471e6575ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CA$\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, respectively.\n</p><p>Show that\n</p><p>a)<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/d/23da218927fde9730102e1f2b1b8fd353ac3e5cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_a\\cdot{a} +r_b\\cdot{b} &lt;=|PC|\\cdot{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"195\" height=\"18\" /> and also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/a/2ca6264c6534f85c6126aacd9e9c6a57e6abf961.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_a\\cdot b + r_b\\cdot a&lt;=|PC|\\cdot c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"195\" height=\"18\" />,\nwhere <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/1/7a1118ca611503d0ee4fd47a417a66effb1a7930.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = |BC|, b = |CA|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/2/4422c105751f87841af828ba9efbfba7220dc47f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = |AB|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>b) (Assuming the inequalities of part a) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/2/ba21b294dcb7720eef414993cb36f6aa42548a34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{|PA| + |PB| + |PC|}{r_a + r_b + r_c}&gt;=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"211\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II\" title=\"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II\">2016 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mathcontest.unm.edu/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>last question</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Pro